1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,750
In Colombian road freight, the truck moves today.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,800
The cash often doesn't.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:12,100
Drivers and carriers wait on invoices while fuel, tolls, and payroll don't wait.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,850
Working capital is the real bottleneck on the Andes corridor.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,050
Teclogi is AI fintech for Andean road freight.

6
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:28,600
Loggicash underwrites working capital against live dispatch, e-POD, and RNDC manifests —

7
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,200
the same signals that prove the load.

8
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,750
Marketplace and ops aren't the headline.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,300
They're the underwriting engine.

10
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:41,970
Capital follows the freight, not a spreadsheet from last month.

11
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:47,550
When the truck clears the dock, liquidity can move with it —

12
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:51,900
so carriers keep rolling instead of waiting on the bank.

13
00:00:54,600 --> 00:01:00,100
Teclogi. Series A. Building the rails for freight finance in the Andes.
